      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Prediction spread: standard deviation per bucket",
      "description": "Standard deviation of predictions per bucket (10 rows or more). Near 0 means the model outputs a constant: check the champion and the input features. The baseline training cnt std is about 135.",
